### Courses
GET {{UniversityCourseManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/courses?search=web&minCredits=3
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{UniversityCourseManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Algorithms",
  "description": "Core algorithms",
  "credits": 4,
  "teacherId": 1
}

